g.\" That's a positive for crew cooperation. Also \"Candidate C has excellent attention skills.\" That's a positive. So we have additional strengths: puts concern for others above everything, excellent attention skills. Good. Also we have note: \"Candidate C can make correct decisions quickly.\" Already noted. So we can strengthen case for C.\n\nWe should reference Agent 2 and Agent 1's points, and add our own evidence: concern for others, excellent attention, etc. Also note that his communication difficulty may be mitigated by his concern for others. So we can reaffirm recommendation for C.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: agree with previous, add evidence, maintain vote for C.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: {\"agent\":\"agent_3\",\"vote\":\"Candidate C\"}\n\nProceed."}
